  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2909.03 Departmental Decision; Notification to Applicant. If the department’s determination of the applicability of RSA 91-A to material subject to a specific request differs from the applicant’s determination, prior to the release of information the department shall notify the applicant by email or letter of its determination.\n\nSource. #12227, EXEMPT, eff 6-29-17; ss by #12527, eff 5-11-18; ss by #12894, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 10-3-19, EXPIRES: 3-31-20\n\nNew. #13230, eff 7-9-21 (formerly Saf-C 2910.03)\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c2900.html"
